{"seq":31,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"5da7a6e7-01ef-49db-af9b-574a62dc2c71","runId":"run_1_1788507862991","result":"I've written a comprehensive regex pattern to `/app/regex.txt`. Here's how it works:\n\n**Pattern Structure:**\n- `^(?=.*IPv4)` - Lookahead ensures the line contains a valid IPv4 address\n- `.*?(date)` - Matches the last date on the line (using non-greedy `.*?` with a greedy negative lookahead)\n- `(?!.*date)` - Negative lookahead ensures no more dates follow this one\n\n**IPv4 Component:**\n- Each octet: `(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|[1-9][0-9]|[0-9])` \n- Matches 0-255 without leading zeros (prevents \"001.002.003.004\")\n- Word boundaries: `(?<![a-zA-Z0-9])` and `(?![a-zA-Z0-9])`\n\n**Date Component (YYYY-MM-DD):**\n- 31-day months (01,03,05,07,08,10,12): days 01-31\n- 30-day months (04,06,09,11): days 01-30  \n- February: days 01-29 (allowing leap years in any year as specified)\n- Word boundaries prevent matching strings like \"1134-12-1234\"\n\nThe regex with `re.MULTILINE` will correctly:\n- Skip lines without IPv4 addresses\n- Find only the last date on lines that have IPv4 addresses\n- Avoid false matches from adjacent alphanumeric characters","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":132201,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5da7a6e7-01ef-49db-af9b-574a62dc2c71","total_cost_usd":0.1365896,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21478,"cache_read_input_tokens":26321,"output_tokens":21169,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":20166},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21478},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":13632,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":20535,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-2025100